{"title":"照片墙","type":"photos","uid":"d3ed4e04eed6fcf603142d78b59c6163","text":" 这是第一张照片的描述 这是第二张照片的描述 这是第三张照片的描述 .photos-page { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; } .photos-content { background: var(--bac...","date":"2025-05-24T17:51:34.000Z","updated":"2025-08-04T08:22:02.095Z","comments":false,"path":"api/pages/photos/index.json","covers":[],"excerpt":"","content":"<div class=\"photos-page\">\n  <div class=\"photos-content\">\n    <div class=\"photo-gallery\">\n      <div class=\"photo-item\">\n        <img src=\"../images/photos/photo1.jpg\" alt=\"示例照片1\">\n        <div class=\"caption\">这是第一张照片的描述</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-item\">\n        <img src=\"../images/photos/photo2.jpg\" alt=\"示例照片2\">\n        <div class=\"caption\">这是第二张照片的描述</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-item\">\n        <img src=\"../images/photos/photo3.jpg\" alt=\"示例照片3\">\n        <div class=\"caption\">这是第三张照片的描述</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.photos-page {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.photos-content {\n  background: var(--background-primary);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n\n.photo-gallery {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.photo-item {\n  background: var(--background-secondary);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.photo-item:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n}\n\n.photo-item img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 200px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.photo-item .caption {\n  padding: 15px;\n  color: var(--text-normal);\n  font-size: 0.95em;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n</style> ","count_time":{"symbolsCount":980,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"toc":"","data":[]}